            ['Refusing the project on principle', 'Approving without analysis'],
            'I meet the project team to understand the need and data involved, then run a quick risk assessment. I propose proportionate measures: access limited to what is needed, encryption, access logging and pseudonymisation where possible. With the DPO we check GDPR processor clauses and audit rights. The goal is to enable the project with an accepted, documented risk.',
            'risk,encryption,gdpr,support'],
    ],
    ['code' => 'cyber-vuln-mgmt', 'prof' => 'cybersecurity-engineer', 'type' => 'technical', 'lvl' => [2, 4], 'diff' => 3, 'sec' => 180, 'skills' => ['security_mindset', 'organisation'],
        'fr' => ['Comment organisez-vous la gestion des vulnérabilités dans une organisation ?', 'Inventaire, scans, priorisation selon le risque, suivi de la remédiation et indicateurs.',
